sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Gameplay owner
    participant M as Plugin manager
    participant P as Component task
    participant H as Host operations
    O->>O: Prepare facts and decision invocation
    O->>M: Dispatch with authority and deadline
    M->>P: Admit callback
    P->>H: Await an authorized operation
    Note over O: Caller parks without world guards
    H->>O: Enqueue owner-directed work
    O-->>H: Validated operation result
    H-->>P: Resume callback
    P-->>M: Settle decision
    M-->>O: Result or explicit failure
    O->>O: Revalidate and commit or reject
